units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p s
newton on
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 64.54545454545455 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region proj block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region targ block 0 20 0 20 24.545454545454547 64.54545454545455 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix nvt all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt
reset_timestep 0
velocity projectile add 0 0 20
fix nve all nve
run 200000
